From 7a7926f2220790ebe346ce9828fa8b5497db87bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 2026 19:30:44 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4446/5749] chore(tmux-subagent): remove dead event-handler
 modules

Drop cleanup.ts, session-created-handler.ts, and session-deleted-handler.ts
which were never wired up; the lifecycle logic they contained lives inline
in TmuxSessionManager. Barrels trimmed to match.
